{{skl|Taming}} is one of the [[Skills]] available for players to level up as they perform certain actions that give them Taming XP. Leveling Taming increases the player's [[Pets#Leveling|Extra Pet XP]], [[Pets#Exp_Sharing|Exp Share rate]], and {{stat|pl}}.

Like other Skills, [[Roman Numerals]] are used to express its levels in-game.

Although '''Taming''' goes from levels 1 - 60 (I - LX), there is 50 XP required to reach the first level, meaning there is a "level 0", just like all other skills.

The '''Taming''' Level Cap can be increased through {{NPCSprite|George}}, to a maximum of Level 60 (LX). In order to reach this cap, players have to give George specific [[Pets]] (with the same or higher rarity):

* {{Item|Rift Ferret Pet|rarity=E}}
* {{Item|Slug Pet|rarity=E}}
* {{Item|Spirit Pet|rarity=E}}
* {{Item|Giraffe Pet|rarity=E}}
* {{Item|Jellyfish Pet|rarity=E}}
* {{Item|Bal Pet|rarity=E}}
* {{Item|Baby Yeti Pet|rarity=E}}
* {{Item|Black Cat Pet|rarity=L}}
* {{Item|Frost Wisp Pet|rarity=R}}
* {{Item|Enderman Pet|rarity=M}}

The Pets will not be given back to you, so it's recommended to give {{Lv|1}} pets to {{NPCSprite|George}} (or whatever is cheapest).

== Leveling XP ==
The amount of '''Taming XP''' gained depends on the Skill XP gained and on the Pet's type. Using a Pet whose type differs from the skill XP gained results in less Taming XP earned. A pet must be active to earn Taming XP. Different skills result in different amounts of Taming XP gained. 

== Zoologist ==
'''Zoologist''' is an ability exclusively unlocked by leveling up the Taming Skill. Each level of Zoologist grants +1% Pet XP gained and {{stat|pl|+1}}.

Each level of Taming grants one level of Zoologist. For example, if the player were on Taming level 15, the player would therefore also be on Zoologist level 15.

