== Uses ==
Leveling up '''Taming''' is not only good for extra pet luck but can also be used in order to upgrade pets using Kat. Players will need {{Skill|Taming|Level 10}} to get a pet from {{Rare}} to {{Epic}}, {{Skill|Taming|Level 20}} in order to get a pet from {{Epic}} to {{Legendary}}, and {{Skill|Taming|Level 25}} to get a pet from {{Legendary}} to {{Mythic}}. It's also very effective for leveling pets faster if the player has a decent level of at least 25. It can also be used to upgrade the base {{Stat|dmg}} of the {{Item|Daedalus Blade}}.

== Trivia ==
* Doing an action with a pet that is already level 100 still yields Taming XP. The excess of XP will be "credited" to the pet, so if its rarity is upgraded, the excess will be added to the pet's XP. This means that the player's pet can still be level 100 after picking it up from Kat, if it has enough excessive XP at the previous rarity. However, you cannot feed a level 100 pet [[Pet Food]].
*All Pet XP boosts work multiplicatively together: {{Item|Beastmaster Crest}}, {{NPCSprite|Diana}} and [[Pet Items]].
*It costs {{/Cost}} to acquire '''Taming''' 60.
